<section class="example-section">
  <h2 id="shell-heading">Create a bootable Ubuntu USB drive</h2>
  <p></p>

<ul>
<li><a href="https://ubuntu.com/download/desktop">Download Ubuntu desktop</a> (26.04 or latest), you most likely need Intel or AMD architecture for 64 bits.</li>
<li>Verify the download <a href="https://ubuntu.com/tutorials/how-to-verify-ubuntu#1-overview">follow these instructions</a></li>
<li>to create the bootable USB from the downloaded image install: on Mac <a href="https://github.com/balena-io/etcher/releases">balenaEtcher</a> and on Windows <a href="https://rufus.ie/">Rufus</a></li>
<li>Insert the USB and open the corresponding app, select the USB disk, ISO image, and flash it.</li>
</ul>
